      "content": "As is discussed in Chapter 25, the variance of the liability distribution can always be set equal to one. Defining $ \\Phi(x) = \\Pr(U \\leq x) $ as the cumulative distribution function for a unit normal U, the integral in Equation 13.30 can be written as",
